{
  "source": "projects/cemi_episode_01/data/episode.json",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "S01-03-L01",
      "shot": "S01-03",
      "text": "Amaia had fourteen when they put the canoes in. By the third night she had eleven.",
      "speaker": "Amaia",
      "speaker_inferred": false,
      "voiceover": true,
      "field": "sound",
      "shot_start_frame": 648,
      "shot_frames": 192,
      "max_seconds": 8.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S01-08-L01",
      "shot": "S01-08",
      "text": "There's a way under the roots.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 1584,
      "shot_frames": 144,
      "max_seconds": 6.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S01-10-L01",
      "shot": "S01-10",
      "text": "They know where we were. They don't know where we are.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 2064,
      "shot_frames": 144,
      "max_seconds": 6.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S01-13-L01",
      "shot": "S01-13",
      "text": "It's turning with us. Turn with it.",
      "speaker": "son",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 2784,
      "shot_frames": 144,
      "max_seconds": 6.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03-01-L01",
      "shot": "S03-01",
      "text": "I'll start with the part I'm not proud of, because my mother says if you start with the part you're proud of, God stops listening.",
      "speaker": "JC",
      "speaker_inferred": false,
      "voiceover": true,
      "field": "sound",
      "shot_start_frame": 3528,
      "shot_frames": 168,
      "max_seconds": 7.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03-02-L01",
      "shot": "S03-02",
      "text": "...I could pass a sandwich to the conductor.",
      "speaker": "VO",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "sound",
      "shot_start_frame": 3696,
      "shot_frames": 96,
      "max_seconds": 4.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03-05-L01",
      "shot": "S03-05",
      "text": "...all it did was listen through the walls and tell me everybody's business.",
      "speaker": "JC",
      "speaker_inferred": false,
      "voiceover": true,
      "field": "sound",
      "shot_start_frame": 4344,
      "shot_frames": 168,
      "max_seconds": 7.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03-06-L01",
      "shot": "S03-06",
      "text": "The coin is copper, heavy for its size...it runs warm.",
      "speaker": "VO",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "sound",
      "shot_start_frame": 4512,
      "shot_frames": 240,
      "max_seconds": 10.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S05-07-L01",
      "shot": "S05-07",
      "text": "It was the mark on my coin.",
      "speaker": "JC",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "sound",
      "shot_start_frame": 7608,
      "shot_frames": 120,
      "max_seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06-02-L01",
      "shot": "S06-02",
      "text": "Juan Carlos. Se fue la luz.",
      "speaker": "Mamá",
      "speaker_inferred": false,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 9264,
      "shot_frames": 384,
      "max_seconds": 16.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06-02-L02",
      "shot": "S06-02",
      "text": "It's the whole block, Má.",
      "speaker": "JC",
      "speaker_inferred": false,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 9264,
      "shot_frames": 384,
      "max_seconds": 16.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06-02-L03",
      "shot": "S06-02",
      "text": "Acuéstate.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 9264,
      "shot_frames": 384,
      "max_seconds": 16.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-03-L01",
      "shot": "S07-03",
      "text": "La luz se fue a las tres y volvió a las cuatro. Con Ed says transformer. The super says Con Ed. Doña Fela on five says it was the Lord.",
      "speaker": "Mamá",
      "speaker_inferred": false,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 10368,
      "shot_frames": 528,
      "max_seconds": 22.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-03-L02",
      "shot": "S07-03",
      "text": "What do you say?",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 10368,
      "shot_frames": 528,
      "max_seconds": 22.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-03-L03",
      "shot": "S07-03",
      "text": "I say the keyboard stopped at three-oh-seven. I look at the clock when you don't sleep. Siéntate.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 10368,
      "shot_frames": 528,
      "max_seconds": 22.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-04-L01",
      "shot": "S07-04",
      "text": "Tu abuela llamó anoche. Antes de que se fuera la luz.",
      "speaker": "Mamá",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 10896,
      "shot_frames": 336,
      "max_seconds": 14.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-04-L02",
      "shot": "S07-04",
      "text": "She good?",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 10896,
      "shot_frames": 336,
      "max_seconds": 14.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-04-L03",
      "shot": "S07-04",
      "text": "She's old, she's stubborn, she's good.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 10896,
      "shot_frames": 336,
      "max_seconds": 14.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-04-L04",
      "shot": "S07-04",
      "text": "She asked if it already started.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 10896,
      "shot_frames": 336,
      "max_seconds": 14.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-06-L01",
      "shot": "S07-06",
      "text": "Eat lunch. A real one. Not coffee.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 11472,
      "shot_frames": 288,
      "max_seconds": 12.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-06-L02",
      "shot": "S07-06",
      "text": "Promise.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 11472,
      "shot_frames": 288,
      "max_seconds": 12.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-06-L03",
      "shot": "S07-06",
      "text": "You said that yesterday.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 11472,
      "shot_frames": 288,
      "max_seconds": 12.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07-06-L04",
      "shot": "S07-06",
      "text": "I'll mean it harder today.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 11472,
      "shot_frames": 288,
      "max_seconds": 12.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S08-03-L01",
      "shot": "S08-03",
      "text": "Morning.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 12144,
      "shot_frames": 384,
      "max_seconds": 16.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S08-03-L02",
      "shot": "S08-03",
      "text": "You guys work late?",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 12144,
      "shot_frames": 384,
      "max_seconds": 16.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S08-03-L03",
      "shot": "S08-03",
      "text": "Nights? Nah. Union. We clock out at three-thirty. Daylight only.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 12144,
      "shot_frames": 384,
      "max_seconds": 16.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-03-L01",
      "shot": "S09-03",
      "text": "Dime a ver, poeta. And that face.",
      "speaker": "Mr. Rodríguez",
      "speaker_inferred": false,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 12912,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-03-L02",
      "shot": "S09-03",
      "text": "What face?",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 12912,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-03-L03",
      "shot": "S09-03",
      "text": "That one. You look like you're getting a station the rest of us don't get.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 12912,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-03-L04",
      "shot": "S09-03",
      "text": "Long night. The power went out.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 12912,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-03-L05",
      "shot": "S09-03",
      "text": "The whole block, sí. Doña Fela says the Lord. Go. It's Tuesday, three gigs, no lunch. I'm not paying you to look haunted. Although it's good for the brand.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 12912,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-06-L01",
      "shot": "S09-06",
      "text": "Your building's empty. The Ballroom. Saturday nights, mambo bands, my mother in her best shoes. I have the dates wrong, I know I do. You live upstairs. Ask your mother.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 13752,
      "shot_frames": 264,
      "max_seconds": 11.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-06-L02",
      "shot": "S09-06",
      "text": "Because when they change the block they change the story, and I want the story on paper first.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 13752,
      "shot_frames": 264,
      "max_seconds": 11.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-01-L01",
      "shot": "S10-01",
      "text": "For the labor. I'm management now. I delegate hydration.",
      "speaker": "Manny",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14016,
      "shot_frames": 120,
      "max_seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-02-L01",
      "shot": "S10-02",
      "text": "allergic to emotions.",
      "speaker": "Manny",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14136,
      "shot_frames": 216,
      "max_seconds": 9.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L01",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "You good?",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L02",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "Long night.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L03",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "You always say long night. You ever have a short one?",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L04",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "Twice. 2019. It was great.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L05",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "How's the kid's EP?",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L06",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "Done.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L07",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "So send it.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L08",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "It needs one more pass.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L09",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "It's needed one more pass for a week, gremlin. Sunday. Rafa's circle in the park, you coming? Bring nothing. Stand in the back.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L10",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "I'll try.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10-04-L11",
      "shot": "S10-04",
      "text": "That's a no in a nicer shirt.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 14688,
      "shot_frames": 432,
      "max_seconds": 18.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L01",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "What was that face?",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L02",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "Spam.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L03",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "Bro. Hardware? A budget? A commission at the Armory? That's a real stage, JC.",
      "speaker": "JC",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L04",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "I'm not calling them back.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L05",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "Why.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L06",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "I can't explain it. I'm not doing it.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L07",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "Last time you couldn't explain it, it was the dude selling Hennessy out a Honda, and you were right. It'll cost you, though. Real money.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L08",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "I know.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11-06-L09",
      "shot": "S11-06",
      "text": "Just so the record reflects I tried to make you rich. Sofía's gonna make a spreadsheet. It's gonna have tabs.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 16368,
      "shot_frames": 576,
      "max_seconds": 24.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S12-06-L01",
      "shot": "S12-06",
      "text": "Dos iguales? You got two turntables?",
      "speaker": "kid",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 17640,
      "shot_frames": 384,
      "max_seconds": 16.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S12-06-L02",
      "shot": "S12-06",
      "text": "Todavía no.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 17640,
      "shot_frames": 384,
      "max_seconds": 16.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S12-08-L01",
      "shot": "S12-08",
      "text": "JC. JC.",
