      "shot_start_frame": 21672,
      "shot_frames": 120,
      "max_seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14-02-L03",
      "shot": "S14-02",
      "text": "With a face like somebody ran over your dog.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 21672,
      "shot_frames": 120,
      "max_seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14-05-L01",
      "shot": "S14-05",
      "text": "That's a loop. That's every hold music in America.",
      "speaker": "JC",
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 22416,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14-05-L02",
      "shot": "S14-05",
      "text": "It's under everything on the block. No tune. It makes whatever it's under feel pressed flat. And the block's been mean lately.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 22416,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14-05-L03",
      "shot": "S14-05",
      "text": "I've noticed it's been a long winter and the landlord on Creston is a monster.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 22416,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14-05-L04",
      "shot": "S14-05",
      "text": "What I don't have is a number... I need a control. A block without it.",
      "speaker": null,
      "speaker_inferred": true,
      "voiceover": false,
      "field": "action",
      "shot_start_frame": 22416,
      "shot_frames": 480,
      "max_seconds": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14-06-L01",
      "shot": "S14-06",
      "text": "Name me the one inside a mile that didn't sign.",
